estutils R2.6).\"\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: \"difftest_test.go compiles with no errors under go vet ./pkg/testutils/...\"\n      - id: AC2\n        text: \"All tests pass with go test -v ./pkg/testutils/...\"\n      - id: AC3\n        text: \"Tests cover: matching-output pass, stdout divergence, stderr divergence, exit-code divergence, timestamp normalization, composed normalization, and ExpectedFiles pass and fail\"\n      - id: AC4\n        text: \"No test depends on external binaries (GNU coreutils); all use self-contained helper programs built during test setup\"\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":46346,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"91483e6f-c27c-44dd-b5b3-54d974f67ab3","uuid":"dae377e6-2c3a-489e-8150-d85880c00ffc"}
